# Vercel builds the desktop UI and nothing else — the server it proxies to lives
# on a host with a disk (see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md). None of the following is used
# by that build, and the two virtualenvs are tens of thousands of files.
#
# Deploying through the Git integration only ever sees tracked files, so this
# matters mainly to `vercel` run from the command line, which uploads the
# working directory as it finds it — venvs, databases and all.
backend/
Textile Retail Shop/
android/
mobile-app/
docs/

**/.venv
**/.venv-win
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.db
*.db.bak*
